# aux-aux: Can two aux quantities share a name (XPPAUT 8.2.2)?
# xpp: q=2 z=9
# pc: ODE0041
# ruling: PhaseCont choice. XPPAUT prints "duplicate name" but loads it and writes both columns (q is 2*x, then 3*x, and z is the fifth column of the row). pc-ode keeps ODE0041, because the output would have two columns with one name.
x'=-x
x(0)=1
aux q=2*x
aux q=3*x
aux z=9
@ total=1,dt=0.5
